	column 'Actual Sales' = ```
			
			IF(
			    'Forecast_Product_Table'[Date] < TODAY(),
			    COALESCE(
			        LOOKUPVALUE(
			            'HEADER'[NetSales],
			            'HEADER'[VoucherDate],    'Forecast_Product_Table'[Date],
			            'HEADER'[Brand],          'Forecast_Product_Table'[CHAINID],
			            'HEADER'[LOCATIONID],     'Forecast_Product_Table'[LOCATIONID]  -- Fixed: added missing quote & comma
			        ), 
			        0
			    ),
			    BLANK()
			)
			```
		lineageTag: b9c26d13-6ddc-40da-a15e-29b71931c2d4
		summarizeBy: sum

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

